  "id": "readiness",
  "term": "readiness",
  "definition": "Readiness is a person’s perceived state of being prepared for an important task or upcoming demand. In this psychology context, it refers to how prepared students feel for high-stakes examinations, and it is linked with stronger study habits and motivation while tending to be lower when anxiety is higher.",
